  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WFP urban cash transfers, development and mainstreaming the Toose GBV approach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of this extension is both to meet the immediate food security needs of 11,000 of the most vulnerable urban dwellers in Zimbabwe, and at the same time to support WFP to capitalise on its partnership with the FCDO-funded SAFE programme to change the way that WFP approaches gender transformative programming &#x2013; in Zimbabwe and globally.</narrative>
  </description>
